# GitHub humanize (P2394)

Never post GitHub issue/PR comments that read as AI/bot (patch walls, “Silent update”, “Auto-resolved”, “automation cycle”, emoji thank-you macros).

- Prefer silent code/CI. If commenting: Dylan voice — short, “I”, imperfect English OK.
- Automations: reopen without comment; diag-resolver dry-run (`GITHUB_RESOLVER_COMMENT=0`).
- Doctrine: `docs/rules/GITHUB_HUMANIZE.md` · voice: `docs/responses/FORUM_STYLE_GUIDE.md`
